<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Subscribe — {{ brand.PUBLICATION }} · {{ brand.SITE_NAME }}</title>
<meta name="description" content="Get {{ brand.PUBLICATION }} in your inbox, {{ brand.CADENCE }}.">
<link rel="canonical" href="{{ brand.SITE_URL }}/subscribe.html">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="{{ brand.SITE_NAME }}">
<meta property="og:title" content="Subscribe to {{ brand.PUBLICATION }}">
<meta property="og:description" content="{{ brand.TAGLINE }} One email a {{ brand.CADENCE_NOUN }}, free.">
<meta property="og:url" content="{{ brand.SITE_URL }}/subscribe.html">
{#- This was a meta-refresh to the provider's hosted page. It is a real page
    now: the form posts to them directly, so a reader stays on this domain until
    the moment they actually submit. The URL was always the point — it is what
    gets printed, posted to a forum and pasted into a club's chat, and it keeps
    working if the provider ever changes. #}
<style>
  /* The same ground, ink and measure as an issue. Single-theme by choice. */
  :root {
    --page: #ffffff; --ground: #f6f7f8; --ink: #16191d; --ink-soft: #545e69;
    --ink-faint: #8b959f; --rule: #e4e8eb; --link: #0b5fbe;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0; background: var(--page); color: var(--ink);
    font: 15px/1.55 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
  }
  .wrap { max-width: 34rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2.25rem 1.15rem 4rem; }

  h1.wordmark { margin: 0 0 1.2rem; font-size: 0; line-height: 0; }
  h1.wordmark img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; }
  .fallback {
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem 1.4rem 1.6rem; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    background: linear-gradient(155deg, #3585b8 0%, #1d5f92 45%, #102a3f 100%);
  }
  .fallback .name { margin: 0; font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.035em; }

  p.lede { margin: 0 0 1.2rem; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  p.lede strong { color: var(--ink); }

  ul.what { margin: 0 0 1.4rem; padding-left: 1.15rem; font-size: .92rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  ul.what li { margin: .35rem 0; }

  .subscribe {
    padding: 1.15rem 1.15rem 1.2rem;
    background: var(--ground); border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 10px;
  }
  .subscribe h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.015em; }
  .subscribe .pitch { margin: .3rem 0 .8rem; font-size: .88rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .subscribe .row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem; }
  .subscribe input[type="email"] {
    flex: 1 1 14rem; min-width: 0; font: inherit; font-size: .95rem; min-height: 44px;
    padding: .6rem .7rem; color: var(--ink); background: var(--page);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .subscribe input[type="email"]:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--link); outline-offset: 1px; border-color: var(--link);
  }
  .subscribe button {
    font: inherit; font-size: .95rem; font-weight: 700; min-height: 44px;
    padding: .6rem 1.1rem; color: #fff; background: var(--link);
    border: 0; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .subscribe button:hover { background: #094a95; }
  .subscribe .note { margin: .6rem 0 0; font-size: .75rem; color: var(--ink-faint); }
  .subscribe .note a { color: var(--ink-faint); }

  .visually-hidden {
    position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; margin: -1px;
    padding: 0; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0;
  }

  footer {
    margin-top: 2rem; padding-top: 1.1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-size: .82rem; color: var(--ink-faint);
  }
  footer a { color: var(--link); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  {% if header %}
  <h1 class="wordmark">
    <a href="./"><img src="{{ header[0] }}"
      {%- if header[1] %} width="{{ header[1] }}"{% endif %}
      {%- if header[2] %} height="{{ header[2] }}"{% endif %}
      alt="{{ brand.PUBLICATION }} — {{ brand.SITE_NAME }}. {{ brand.TAGLINE }}"></a>
  </h1>
  {% else %}
  <div class="fallback"><p class="name">{{ brand.PUBLICATION }}</p></div>
  {% endif %}

  <p class="lede">
    <strong>{{ brand.TAGLINE }}</strong>
    One email a {{ brand.CADENCE_NOUN }}, free, carrying what was worth reading
    that {{ brand.CADENCE_NOUN }} in the reef aquarium hobby — and the science
    underneath it.
  </p>

  <ul class="what">
    <li>Industry and product news, husbandry and science, wild reef conditions.</li>
    <li>Primary literature and public-aquarium practice, not only the trade press.</li>
    <li>Every item credits and links its source. Nothing here is reproduced.</li>
  </ul>

  {% include "_subscribe-form.html.j2" %}

  <footer>
    <p>
      <a href="./">Read the current issue</a> ·
      <a href="archive.html">Back issues</a> ·
      <a href="about.html">About &amp; sourcing policy</a>
    </p>
  </footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>
